+;FocusKeepFG=1
+; HoldComposition=1 (default) keeps DWM composing the game's monitor while NR runs at the
+;  FG input and the game window is shown: a 2x2, near-transparent, click-through,
+;  non-activating tool window of this process sits at that monitor's top-left corner.
+;  Without it, Windows promotes the unfocused game to Independent Flip and back, and
+;  Streamline presents ~12 raw frames without FG (hence without NR) at each switch.
+;  Read every second; 0 removes it.
 ;HoldComposition=1
-; HoldCompositionAlpha=1..255 (default 1) is the window's opacity; HoldCompositionHideCapture=1
-;  (default) excludes it from screenshots and recordings where Windows supports that.
+; HoldCompositionAlpha=1..255 (default 1) is that window's opacity. Read every second.
 ;HoldCompositionAlpha=1
-;HoldCompositionHideCapture=1
